{"id":"18a7d6d6f6148b37","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-inseparable-pair.md","title":"Finite Inseparability over Two Letter Languages","display":"df-inseparable-pair — Finite Inseparability over Two Letter Languages","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-inseparable-pair","aliases":["89-df-inseparable-pair"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-inseparable-pair — Finite Inseparability over Two Letter Languages","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-inseparable-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-inseparable-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inseparable-pair — Finite Inseparability over Two Letter Languages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ff66b5cf43748aff\" href=\"?note=ff66b5cf43748aff\" title=\"89-df-modal-godel-code\">89-df-modal-godel-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为实际语法集函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_0,\\mathcal V_1,X,X^{\\pm}\">\\(\\mathcal V_0,\\mathcal V_1,X,X^{\\pm}\\)</span> 是下文引入的语言与有限闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i\">\\(S_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的语言投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}_{A,C}(S,B),\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}_{A,C}(S,B),\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)\\)</span> 为下文定义的分离与不可分离谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\\)</span> 为有限极大集载体。</li>\n<li>所有有限集合的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigwedge\\)</span> 先按固定语法编码排序，再使用已有序列折叠；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq X^{\\pm}\">\\(S\\subseteq X^{\\pm}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>本条的有限公式排序使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ff66b5cf43748aff\" href=\"?note=ff66b5cf43748aff\" title=\"89-df-modal-godel-code\">89-df-modal-godel-code</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sort}\">\\(\\operatorname{sort}\\)</span>；其他有限指标序列仍按已声明的自然数顺序。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal V_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal V_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(C)\\},\\\\\nX&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(\\neg C),\n&amp;X^{\\pm}&amp;\\coloneqq X\\cup\\{\\neg D:D\\in X\\},\\\\\nS_i&amp;\\coloneqq S\\cap\\mathcal V_i\\quad(i=0,1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{A,C}(S,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal V_0\\cap\\mathcal V_1\n\\land(\\bigwedge S_0\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land(\\bigwedge S_1\\to\\neg B)\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{Sep}_{A,C}(S,B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq X^{\\pm}:\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)\n\\land\\forall D\\in X\\;(D\\in S\\lor\\neg D\\in S)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal V_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal V_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(C)\\},\\\\\nX&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(\\neg C),\n&amp;X^{\\pm}&amp;\\coloneqq X\\cup\\{\\neg D:D\\in X\\},\\\\\nS_i&amp;\\coloneqq S\\cap\\mathcal V_i\\quad(i=0,1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{A,C}(S,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal V_0\\cap\\mathcal V_1\n\\land(\\bigwedge S_0\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land(\\bigwedge S_1\\to\\neg B)\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{Sep}_{A,C}(S,B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq X^{\\pm}:\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)\n\\land\\forall D\\in X\\;(D\\in S\\lor\\neg D\\in S)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 119；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>每个闭包公式属于至少一侧语言，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=S_0\\cup S_1\">\\(S=S_0\\cup S_1\\)</span>；共同语言公式同时投影到两侧。载体是有限幂集的分离，不假定有不可分离集存在。这里“极大”表示对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 每个公式都作正负决定，正是原书约定，不是全语言极大一致集。\n若某一侧投影不一致，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 给分离公式；故不可分离性保证两侧投影都 GL 一致。反过来，整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 一致则不可分离，但不可分离性不要求整集一致。这一区别是插值构造不能直接复用普通一致集构造的原因。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-godel-code","status":"resolved","id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-godel-code","status":"resolved","id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的有限公式排序使用 [[89-df-modal-godel-code]] 的 $\\operatorname{sort}$；其他有限指标序列仍按已声明的自然数顺序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_0,\\mathcal V_1,X,X^{\\pm}","display":false},{"tex":"S_i","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}_{A,C}(S,B),\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq X^{\\pm}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sort}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal V_0&\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal V_1&\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(D)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(C)\\},\\\\\nX&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(\\neg C),\n&X^{\\pm}&\\coloneqq X\\cup\\{\\neg D:D\\in X\\},\\\\\nS_i&\\coloneqq S\\cap\\mathcal V_i\\quad(i=0,1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{A,C}(S,B)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal V_0\\cap\\mathcal V_1\n\\land(\\bigwedge S_0\\to B)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land(\\bigwedge S_1\\to\\neg B)\\in\\mathrm{GL},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{Sep}_{A,C}(S,B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}&\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq X^{\\pm}:\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(S)\n\\land\\forall D\\in X\\;(D\\in S\\lor\\neg D\\in S)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S=S_0\\cup S_1","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":2756,"backlinks":[{"id":"e46af049d0ea6278","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"28ea14cb0d1e7474","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"40d41bb5aac76af5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-inseparable-pair]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"第三种存在证明：[[89-df-inseparable-pair]] → [[89-lem-inseparable-extension]] → [[89-lem-inseparable-box-witness]] → [[89-thm-craig-interpolation]] → [[89-thm-beth-definability]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-beth]]。"}],"outgoing":["71b4f56d6213ff7c","ca21b68a25f1afc2","0006800fa1c85177","ff66b5cf43748aff"]}